o 4 no reparó QUITO. lat='{lat_rec.iloc[0]}'\"\n343:         )\n344: \n345:     def test_canton_incorrecto_no_rescata(self, mapa_cantonal):\n346:         \"\"\"\n347:         Verifica que un punto en cantón erróneo NO se rescata.\n348:         Coordenada de Guayaquil reportada como QUITO → no debe validar.\n349:         \"\"\"\n350:         # Prueba negativa: aunque el punto cae en Ecuador (Guayaquil), el registro","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":454,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:37Z","input_tokens":4104,"cache_read_tokens":118884,"output_tokens":1587,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe data shows inconsistencies; specifically, `EL PIEDRERO` and `LA TRONCAL` are associated with `CANAR` and `GUAYAQUIL`. The Ministry of the Interior and SENPLADES's operational structure, as per Ministerial Agreement 557-2012, places `EL PIEDRERO` under `LA TRONCAL` within the `CAÑAR` province. This is based on territorial and administrative boundaries defined by relevant national laws and regulations.\n\n\nAnalysis confirms that provincial jurisdiction consistently assigns \"EL PIEDRERO\" to \"CANAR\", specifically under \"LA TRONCAL\", across statistical and police registries from 2010-2024. Homologating \"CANAR\", \"EL PIEDRERO\" to \"LA TRONCAL\" maintains provincial consistency and consolidates related records. The single record with a \"GUAYAS\", \"GUAYAQUIL\" assignment warrants keeping separate.\n\n\nAdding the three previously undefined zones to the canton homologation map is necessary. Updating the configuration file to include these mappings will ensure consistent territorial alignment. A second mapping will also be included for shapefile processing.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"\"D:\\\\Tesis\\\\src\\\\ingesta\\\\config.py\"","Replacement":"\"# Provincias a excluir del mapa base\\n# Se usa en la Fase 4 (cartografia.py) para quitar del mapa la región insular\\n# que no forma parte del análisis continental. Las antiguas \\\"ZONA NO DELIMITADA\\\"\\n# (Manga del Cura, Las Golondrinas y El Piedrero) ya NO se excluyen, sino que se\\n# homologan a su jurisdicción provincial y cantonal vigente (Opción A).\\nPROVINCIAS_EXCLUIR_MAPA = [\\\"GALAPAGOS\\\"]\"","Target":"\"# Provincias a excluir del mapa base\\n# Se usa en la Fase 4 (cartografia.py) para quitar del mapa las zonas que\\n# no forman parte del análisis continental.\\nPROVINCIAS_EXCLUIR_MAPA = [\\\"GALAPAGOS\\\", \\\"ZONA NO DELIMITADA\\\"]\""}}]}
