 1)\n\ncols = ['codigo_caso', 'anio_hecho', 'provincia', 'canton', 'DPA_DESPRO', 'CANTON_MAPA', 'nearest_can', 'dist_nearest_m', 'dist_rep_m', 'lat_num', 'lon_num']\nprint(sj[cols].sort_values(['DPA_DESPRO', 'provincia', 'canton']).to_string())\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/Alu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f13cc2bc-2a33-43bd-9a7e-0aa042316f37/.system_generated/tasks/task-491.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE.\n When updating the user, always respond in the language of the user (defaulting to English). Never mix two or more languages in the same response."}
